{
  "_about": [
    "Read by scripts/check_privacy_manifests.py: the reviewed record of every Apple target that ships a bundle.",
    "Per target: manifest (in the target's Resources phase), entitlements, where the manifest and executable sit",
    "in an .xcarchive (bundle), binary_categories (what the archived executable links, measured with --archive",
    "on unsigned Release archives, sentry-cocoa included), reasons (category -> reason code -> why it holds and the",
    "call sites or SDK it rests on; the manifest must declare exactly these, and every cited call site must still be",
    "compiled into the target), and collected (the target's NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypes rows, each a row of the label).",
    "Sentry is merged into all five executables. Its own manifest ships in the iPhone app, the Watch app, the Mac app",
    "and the LoginItem (Frameworks/Sentry.framework); the widget extension carries none. No target relies on it:",
    "each target's own manifest declares what its executable links. A Sentry bump needs a fresh --archive measurement",
    "(the check fails while Package.resolved's pin differs from sdks.sentry-cocoa.version).",
    "label: the App Store App Privacy label as published (2026-11-10). Change a row only together with the label.",
    "package.targets: every target CLIPulseCore's Package.swift declares (kind, path, dependencies), compared exactly;",
    "reviewed_build_settings: (EXCLUDED|INCLUDED)_SOURCE_FILE_NAMES[...] settings and .xcconfig bases, project or target, any configuration (none today)."
  ],
  "scope": [
    "Required-reason rules govern App Store uploads. The reasons recorded here are reviewed for the App Store builds:",
    "the iPhone/iPad app with its widgets and Watch app, and the sandboxed Mac App Store app and LoginItem, where",
    "outside their containers the Mac app reads only folders the user grants (3B52.1). The Developer ID Mac build is",
    "built from the same targets and ships the same manifest, but it is not sandboxed and reads those CLI folders",
    "(~/.claude, ~/.codex, ~/.gemini, the JetBrains configuration) without a grant; its copy of the manifest is not a",
    "claim Apple reviews, and 3B52.1's text does not describe that build. No product behaviour depends on this."
  ],
